# Tailwind & Theme

- Prefer theme tokens from `src/styles/theme.css` (e.g. `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `border-border`) over arbitrary colors.
- Use Tailwind utility classes; avoid inline styles unless necessary for dynamic values.
- Global styles and Tailwind entry: `src/styles/index.css`.
- Keep `src/styles/index.css` imports as the canonical style entrypoint (`fonts.css`, `tailwind.css`, `theme.css`) unless doing a deliberate styling refactor.
